\par }{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4544114 While writing he always think about his readers and he use to make sentences with which he can clear the points. Good writer always focus on the surround nature and time if t}{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4478570 he}{
\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4544114  }{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4478570 is}{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4544114  writing about a journey.
\par For example: if he is traveling from US to Canada. He will mentioned like this: when we start journey the climate was good, there were no sign of clouds and rain, but when we reached Sioux }{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4478570 City}{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4544114 
 the fuel tank was almost finished and then we refuel it from Sioux, there were heavy clouds but with drizzling, the distance }{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4478570 from Sioux}{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4544114  to CANADA is 400 miles. Etc
